# Python packages for the AI process in the API container: the four LangGraph graphs in ../ai,
# the Companion's calendar sign-in service and the ingestion package. Versions match the AI
# engineer's tested environment (ai/.ai_builder_env, 2026-10-12). requirements.lock is generated:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.lock --python-version 3.13 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --generate-hashes
# Not needed in the server: ai/voice (local console), langchain-openai/anthropic, notebook, langgraph-cli.

